      {
       "text": "Clear before clever: every screen has one obvious next step."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "numbered",
     "text": [
      {
       "text": "Consistent: the same thing looks and acts the same everywhere."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "numbered",
     "text": [
      {
       "text": "Accessible by default: contrast, focus and keyboard are part of done."
      }
